a solid body;
(a) a support, foundation (Arist., ועוד); בהשאלה, strength (תה.17:1-15 70:1-5, 1Mac, ll. with); steadfastness, firmness: τ. πίστεως, קל.2:5;
(b) the dome of heaven (believed to be a solid canopy), the firmament (LXX).†
(AS)

en.fuller:
στόμαχος, -ου, ὁ
(στόμα),
prop., a mouth, an opening;
__(a) in early Gk. writers, the throat;
__(b) of the opening of the stomach (Arist.);
__(with) in later writers (Plut., al.), the stomach: 1Ti.5:23.†
(AS)

